{{define "content"}}
<section class="ops-upgrade-server">
<h1>升级为权威端</h1>
{{if .OpsUpgradeServerError}}
<div class="notice notice-error"><p>{{.OpsUpgradeServerError}}</p></div>
{{end}}
{{if .OpsUpgradeServerSuccess}}
<div class="notice notice-success">
<p>本机已升级为权威端。已有服务器、Profile、项目令牌与机密项保持不变。</p>
<p>`sshmgr ui` 即将退出，再次运行它进入权威端初始化向导。</p>
</div>
{{else}}
<p>升级会把本机从单机改为权威端。已有服务器、Profile、项目令牌与机密项保持不变，vault 数据不迁移也不清空。</p>
<p>升级后还需要设置管理员口令、提权安装 serve；正式 Web UI 改由 serve 提供。</p>
<form class="confirm-form" method="post" action="/ui/ops/upgrade-server/confirm">
<input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="{{.CSRFToken}}">
<label class="confirm-choice"><input type="checkbox" name="confirm" value="1" required>我确认现在把本机升级为权威端</label>
<button type="submit">确认升级为权威端</button>
</form>
{{end}}
</section>
{{end}}
